      "comment": "KIA KEEPING (8) jumped favourite and quickly to the front but run down late to finish third (29.57) at this track in a Grade 2/3/4 over 512m. Good beginner but will need a little luck early crossing from an outside draw. Must come into calculations. MEPUNGA INFRARED (1) finished in the placings last time but could not have been more impressive before that in his lightning 29.47 win at this track over 512m. Must include on winning run two back. STATUE OF TIME (5) goes very well this course and distance starting nine times for four wins and three minors. Scored by 0.8 lengths last time (29.51) in a Grade 2/3/4 over 512m at this track. Among the main chances. MISS CHAPO (7) is worth some thought after placing last start.",
